ding with scp-682  a more palatable way of perceiving his  new reality and if he ever wanted to get  out and be himself again he would need  to fight and conquer the beast within dr  bright joined forces with his past  victims including one former level 2  researcher damian smith together using  their electro staffs bright and his army  of mental constructs blasted the great  monster in the sky from the safe  confines of the castle however things  weren't quite as safe as dr bright had  first imagined the massive creature  descended upon them tearing the castle  to shreds with its huge claws the  construct of damon smith was devoured in  the process dr bright's brief illusion  of victory was soon stifled by one  immutable fact you could not defeat  scp-682  he retreated from the monster into the  darkness of his own nightmares from  there he woke up dr bright was in a  hospital bed the medallion attached to a  new body after 682's body had rejected  it he was greeted by dr sophia light and  a member of the o5 council dr wright had  effectively been gone for days when he  asked what happened on the outside he  was told that 682 had entered a 36-hour  coma before growing massive claws and  tunneling out of containment where it  caused a massive breach though strangely  upon breaking out of the chamber it only  attacked one researcher and in unrelated  news dr samet had been taken off the 682  case it didn't take long for things to  return to normal for dr bright well as  normal as life can be when you're a man  as strange as him but while few would  notice it 682 was left altered it had  taken a souvenir from dr bright  fragments of the consciousness of damon  smith it felt his pain his fear it  tasted it dissected it and now  understood it and when the opportunity  presented itself once more as it always  did he couldn't wait to inflict it on  others now go check out scp-682 waze scp  foundation try to kill hard to destroy  reptile and how to kill  scp-682 theories and ideas for more  entries in the seemingly endless quest  to finally put  scp-682 in the ground for good

